      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اصلبت</span></b> , (AA, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِصْلَابٌ</span>, (AA, TA,)
<i>She</i> (a camel) <i>stood stretching forth her neck towards the sky, in order to yield her utmost flow of
milk to her young one.</i> (AA, K, TA.)

